                    "sense_definition": "To resign from a job, office, or position.",
                    "learner_level": "A2",
                    "frequency": "High",
                    "semantic_group_id": "resign",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She was so unhappy with the management that she decided to <w>quit</w> her job.",
